    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3016Humanity's Heart\u3017is a free romance-themed visual novel with 13 romanceable characters, nearly a million words of text, 49 story illustrations, 54 endings, and close to 100 background music tracks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beneath the veneer of human visage, unfamiliar emotions lurk like a shroud of shadows, elusive and inscrutable. As a protagonist freshly initiated into modern university education, you will encounter characters wielding extraordinary abilities throughout your academic journey, gradually unraveling the enigma veiled beneath the ordinary. As panic proliferates, you find yourselves compelled into a relentless pursuit of the buried truth that shatters the fabric of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460 Dual-gender perspective selection allowing players to experience gender-specific legendary narratives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461 a lot of romanceable characters with intricate branching storylines, enhanced by dynamic interactive mechanics that deliver an immersive roleplaying experience.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736430/extras/c8c822c1b4c45c3892a6f9956371b1e6.avif?t=1749453853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736430/extras/4a8c3a497c847a2d9e3e3ef534994c3f.avif?t=1749453853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736430/extras/bf6fbdfaf4eaa05fc604f9edd28ca737.avif?t=1749453853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama